    "title": "Anna Marie Sherman - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By cwilkerson ,\n6 days ago Anna Marie Sherman, 54, of Dawson Springs, KY died Sunday, Sept. 28, 2025 at Baptist Health Deaconess in Madisonville, KY. Anna was born on April 19, 1971 to the late Shirley R. Sherman and Bonnie Mae Harris Brown. She was a beloved mother and grandmother and was of the Christian faith. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
